{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "8858e01b8c6bdea2f418a27a6d41a13b1d0f3f3cca92affde62158a460d3e087", "ja": "流れる星を追いかけて☆", "zh": "追逐流星☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c13226bc471f4fee3face831a8aa19db12b09419a79f21eda63212a5c2c7e936", "ja": "未来達は星梨花の父親の説得に無事成功！\nみんなで流星群を見に行けることとなる。\n夜の登山用の準備に張り切るメンバー達。\n時刻は夕方、用意した車でいざ、目的地に\n向かって出発進行！", "zh": "未来等人成功说服了星梨花的父亲！\n于是大家确定可以一起去看流星雨，\n成员们鼓足了干劲进行夜晚的登山准备。\n当天傍晚，一行人搭上事先安排好的车\n朝目的地前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75152059354004580b7770ad9be5b4f0af899defd2057a1d4e590a952cd68ebd", "ja": "（星梨花の家には、予め電話で連絡を入れておき、\n4人で流星群観測の説明に行った。そして……）", "zh": "（事先打电话联络后，我们四个人一起去拜访\n星梨花她家，说明了观看流星雨的计划。然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b0998499c554db677082d48929c548813e3a1185c82887e39a06aab278d66079", "ja": "よかったですね、{$P$}さん。\n星梨花ちゃんのお父さん、いい人で……♪", "zh": "太好了呢，{$P$}先生。\n星梨花的爸爸人很好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ffc11dde253ffe802309c227bcdf8c2aca875fb304107e5956aa898888c35f8f", "ja": "そうだな。きちんと話もできたし、よかったよ。\n……まあでも、半分は風花のおかげだけど。", "zh": "是啊，能够好好跟他说明，真是太好了。\n……不过有一半都是多亏了风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "479b4a073d0ff3059f9140013d74d3b758d58ae7aff87175f331db683d45ca7e", "ja": "風花が元看護師だって聞いた時、星梨花のお父さんも\n感心してただろ？　本当に助かったよ……ありがとう！", "zh": "听见风花以前是护理师时，星梨花的爸爸不是\n也表示很佩服吗？你真的帮了大忙……谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "af9dd72a0cac61c2cce2ea431e516dcc171155e460653a3497884411d9a314d9", "ja": "えへへ、そんな……。\nでも、役に立てたみたいでよかったです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，也没有啦……\n不过，感觉有帮上忙真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ccb38a7c180f67033059a0ab8a1a18eeb20034222976b3a4e3d514958fb60b5", "ja": "私は？\n私はどうでしたか、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我呢？\n我的表现怎么样？{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "89e864d0176ba525cf80310725d204f5207d60ac6aa54332e9ad1e4c909784d4", "ja": "もちろん、未来にも助けられたよ。劇場でのみんなの\n様子や星梨花のこと、話してくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "当然，未来也帮了很大的忙喔。\n谢谢你说明了大家在剧场的情形还有星梨花的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "87a6195d7bd52101330e05b28a3bb5a898831f8470722af9dffeb68734709470", "ja": "未来さん、風花さん、{$P$}さん。\n本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "未来姊姊、风花姊姊、{$P$}先生。\n真的非常谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "3291aca2c1480aaa7cceb566aa80f4ce753ed6fffebb943a61003eb6ad378f6a", "ja": "わたしが流星群を見に行けるのは、\nみなさんのおかげです……。", "zh": "我能够去看流星雨，\n都是多亏有大家的帮助……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99ddba54bd3e1fafcba944fbc012b356c161684424b419cb06ff7bc70c3adfd1", "ja": "お礼なんかいいんだよ、星梨花ちゃん。", "zh": "不需要说谢谢啦，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "3b868fc8caa23699a607c5428f0fef97b1407c59337552c9843de71af2373727", "ja": "そうだよ！　私、星梨花と一緒に流星群が\n見たかっただけだもん。ですよね、風花さん♪", "zh": "对啊！我只是想跟星梨花一起看流星而已。\n你说对吧，风花姊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "efddaa365dd2097e9196ed63d59c131238586895b04d41c31c889cd7673a4acc", "ja": "未来ちゃんの言うとおり。\nふふっ、流星群、楽しみだね♪", "zh": "未来说得没错。\n呵呵，真期待流星雨呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "10fedffeaa7185f09a680ba88bea3e1ed439ad25c44643f55fe036933260bd08", "ja": "未来さん、風花さん……\nはいっ！", "zh": "未来姊姊、风花姊姊……\n好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "244370b66a3accdc14f67163a7640511ae8e96124d690eaced66807637512d24", "ja": "（星梨花も無事、お父さんの許可がもらえた。\nこれで、みんなで流星群を見に行けるぞ！）", "zh": "（星梨花也顺利取得了爸爸的许可。\n这样一来，大家就能一起去看流星雨了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1062_p", "source_sha256": "320b2958d5d6699fe1357be4ffda86c9042abc3635847deb51ee0273b5d68676", "ja": "（いよいよ週末だ。風花との仕事の後、みんなと\n劇場で合流し、一緒に山に向かう予定なのだが……）", "zh": "（终于到了周末。预计跟风花的工作结束后，\n我们要到剧场跟大家会合，一起上山……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "7660a7f2ef3e2569bf5845bbe52eeeb5b08f8a2b492b47b93fb8a891073a2d70", "ja": "おっ、やっと来たね{$P$}ちゃん！\nそれに風花ちゃんも！", "zh": "哦，你终于来了啊，小{$P$}！\n还有小风花也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d3c9a75663a8d13264d622ea9c7823280df6d9660daf47cf4bd3bf8f250baf51", "ja": "あれ、茜？\n茜は明日、仕事があるから行けないはずじゃ……。", "zh": "咦，茜？\n你不是因为明天有工作，没办法去吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "4ba070cb82f140f13a542d68158054348e92984d4b5dc31a0f1b6e747bb7488d", "ja": "そうなの！　残念だけど、茜ちゃんは流星群ツアーには\n行けないのだよ……。さみしがらせてゴメンね！", "zh": "没错！很可惜，小茜没办法参加流星雨之旅……\n抱歉要让你们寂寞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "73a2186aaec2aae08318b6b958a0d344085a59d7887faa9500db0c4552b69787", "ja": "でも『Starlight Melody!』には出るからね♪\n安心していいよ、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "不过小茜会出席『Starlight Melody!』的♪\n你大可放心喔，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a3b7e19fab9ee6b3d2f7059ad1d80ce917378d77b99d7a8449023e7558c56c7f", "ja": "ああ、もちろん期待してる。\n明日の仕事、頑張れよ！", "zh": "嗯，我当然也很期待啊。\n明天的工作要加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc9571e2a9c805c5efe0ed4327806e7fe93146f6a62c2b9d11bafcbed4d67d28", "ja": "任せて！　茜ちゃんのウィットに富んだアドリブで、\n現場をあっためちゃうよ～ニャハッ☆", "zh": "交给小茜吧！\n小茜会用充满幽默的即兴演出来炒热现场气氛的～喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "d69fbef37dfea1d7b32133e78ee6bc8ec84ef8750112f733d74049452594eb3d", "ja": "じゃ、茜ちゃんは忙しいから帰るね！\n茜ちゃんがいなくてもさみしがらないでね！", "zh": "那么，小茜还有事要忙先回去了！\n就算小茜不在也不要觉得太寂寞喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d828f5987290c97c8c053e3a5ec7888da01a37cf2139b202ef2f457781361766", "ja": "茜……忙しいなら、わざわざ劇場まで来なくても……。", "zh": "茜……你既然很忙，那也不用特别跑到剧场来呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c4df07910e3bdfb736355f174ad358d81f0dd78d0f86e4f90db730dbfe62213d", "ja": "お見送りに来てくれたんじゃないですか？\n茜ちゃん、もしかしたらさみしがってるのかも……。", "zh": "她应该是来送我们走的吧？\n小茜或许是感到寂寞了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed3dbf61929710c410230039e0f703ff493cf7b20cf186319e1202375cd170d2", "ja": "みんなへのお土産、忘れないようにしましょうね、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "我们可要记得带小礼物回来给大家呢，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "797d48e1c8e3f3a6ffa1b2cdf7f344287aba5f5972903bb181b58ebbd45f7895", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nさてと、みんなは……。", "zh": "嗯，你说得对。\n接下来，大家呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "6ba91a37f669d9d2a4426da227b4b0a98d1bb942b1fb1dc7f23a714b353d6cb6", "ja": "ううっ……お、重い……。\nあっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "呜呜……好、好重……\n啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "28194a73208a664c66ec3c1a5ca05a1bb1a5be2d0c9839d825198e43112895ec", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "eeb2d22d92183309922a7a30c3c6d001cf68402baf11424aff021bf78972e3bf", "ja": "亜利沙、琴葉、お疲れさま。\n……？　どうかしたのか、ふたりとも。", "zh": "亚利沙、琴叶，辛苦了。\n……？你们是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "5af7cea16d1f1d31716568d0052cc8d52c00720cdb45754292f5e54900f92a27", "ja": "あっ、すみません。\nすこし、準備に手間取ってしまって……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。\n做准备耽误了一些时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "b802feb03b81715c976780c620a061700b3fc0b561cf1f53f6c5c3700377c64d", "ja": "ひー、ふー。\nありさ、荷物が重くてもうヘトヘトです～。", "zh": "呼──呼──\n行李太重，亚利沙已经不行了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "56f0a30978eed0be26620078f480c769e063f79d4b25ce8b4a544d65de140679", "ja": "荷物？　……亜利沙、これ何が入ってるんだ？\nちょっと大きすぎるような……。", "zh": "行李……？亚利沙，这里面放了什么啊？\n好像有点太大包了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "a4f508aefa6cb7db4a600561ff548b7584c30a398abc1998212a3ba33d97a93c", "ja": "もちろん、パパに借りた望遠レンズです！　これで\nアイドルちゃんも流れ星も、撮りまくりです♪", "zh": "当然是跟爸爸借来的望远镜头啊！\n有了这个，就可以尽情拍摄偶像宝贝跟流星了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d0c3088d36e3e500c6f1a30a146f87d166a8b44d621d833f542c12cfd2799ce2", "ja": "三脚にレンズに、カメラ本体……。\nなるほど、どうりで大荷物なわけだ。", "zh": "脚架、镜头，还有相机……\n原来如此，难怪行李会这么多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "b680c78ba5d3a2dc963e88663c809ae1085f53dba3eb06e2b92ba4e2b3f1c64e", "ja": "アイドルちゃんたちと流星群……こんな絶好の\nシャッターチャンス、滅多にありませんからね！", "zh": "偶像宝贝们跟流星雨……\n像这种超值得按快门的绝佳机会很难得啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "cd2b24fd56f59f8483a16227a2e29897f10534c9caa059c20c031381c895db4e", "ja": "ベストショットのためなら、ありさ、\n弱音なんか吐いていられませんっ！！", "zh": "为了拍出最棒的照片，\n亚利沙可不能吐苦水！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "ae1e009c8f96d119e5afe2efb631cabe268c2b7993989a77fd2f60cadbfd886b", "ja": "もう充分、吐いていた気もするけど……亜利沙、\n今日は山道だ。車移動とはいえ、機材は厳選しよう。", "zh": "我觉得你已经吐不少苦水了……亚利沙，今天要走山路。\n虽然是开车移动，还是少带一些器材吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "a607b33e4bb473c3c3b8f6fe590c9c685d24e4b44ad32eee321007917f099010", "ja": "なんとーっ！？　ぐぬぬ……\nじゃあ残念ですケド、レンズを選びますね……。", "zh": "什么──！？唔唔唔……\n这样的话，虽然很可惜，就选镜头吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "0ff5e2095f26723fdd49bc83493e94ef48ac26a1e97f0b268dee31ddc20531cf", "ja": "そうしてくれると助かる。……あとは、\n琴葉の荷物も、ずいぶん大きいみたいだけど……。", "zh": "你愿意配合就好。\n……还有就是，琴叶的行李好像也很多呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "88b3567a00063799e2e5de5d85e1103c36ee11c2aa7ab0caa7888b7ac33a7c34", "ja": "はい。水筒に非常食にヘッドライトに防寒具を人数分。\n雨具は、誰かが忘れた時のために予備もあります。", "zh": "嗯，里面有每个人的水壶、紧急口粮、头灯和防寒用具。\n为了避免有人忘记带雨具，我也有先准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "f731b7e06d52896e4a1dad7f6896902875dcd192dc59964ee3dac892384541aa", "ja": "ほかに、必要なものは……{$P$}、\nこれだけじゃ足りなかったでしょうか？", "zh": "其他还有什么需要的……{$P$}，\n光准备这些是不是还不够充分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "d048a0dccb15fce77b0391d014374349f46db007867c97c400d617ad4b4cc6d6", "ja": "うん、さすが琴葉だな。非常食なんかは、\n琴葉が持ってきた物のほうが美味しそうだし……。", "zh": "嗯，真不愧是琴叶。\n像紧急口粮，琴叶带来的感觉就比较好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "d73fdc116e2b0bbe8b1c5054ddd3c96ba7ea4cab6487229a2a1ae2a6d841dc47", "ja": "その他の道具は、俺が用意した物と被っているから、\nそれは置いていこう。それでいいか？", "zh": "不过其他用具跟我准备的有重复，就不用带去了。\n这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "e284f9eaab8a9981409be27969d316e68b9a640bd2983f450bcddce27afadab9", "ja": "はい。それじゃ私、片付けておきますね。", "zh": "好的，那么我先整理一下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b449b343500ceb35fc1856792c30729a0c07aa059a24602f9a8a0adae9fd3316", "ja": "ありがとう。よし、俺も自分の荷物を整理して……\nあ、コレはさすがにいらないかな？", "zh": "谢谢。好，我也来整理自己的行李……\n啊，这个应该不需要带去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1050_014mir", "source_sha256": "dfd19fdf2b887cd00271445ed06e6ae193f4e5fb8377132c4ee3dfe98c285351", "ja": "あーっ、{$P$}さん！\n飯ごう持ってきたんですか？", "zh": "啊──{$P$}先生！\n你带了饭盒过来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "90790692bb7f842fcb4a9f458f981719d1d16f5bf125ae3bcf4ec9046202444f", "ja": "お、未来も星梨花も、準備はできてるみたいだな。\nところで未来、飯ごうを知ってるのか？", "zh": "哦，看来未来跟星梨花都准备好了呢。\n话说回来，未来你知道饭盒啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "158cbc31de9c982afd7249f4265fefb036e1d8129066309aad8f45762ef7391a", "ja": "はい！　学校の校外学習の時に、\nそれでご飯を炊いたんです♪", "zh": "是的！以前校外教学的时候，\n我有用饭盒煮过饭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1053_022ser", "source_sha256": "77c456e6e3c7b907cf18b209b2c1d89aa9cd6e73344054073ebb7995b971dff2", "ja": "これで、ご飯が炊けるんですか？\nでも、どうやって……コンセントがありませんよ？", "zh": "用这个可以煮饭吗？\n可是要怎么煮……它上面没有插头耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1054_p", "source_sha256": "0d88a94f6c6f70f932ced366add65215a258816636b208a074d47c7c456493e2", "ja": "飯ごうは、直接火にかけることができるんだよ。\nだからお湯を沸かしたりもできる。", "zh": "饭盒可以直接放在火上面煮喔，\n所以还可以烧开水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "53f6a5f599802d492a632116767e0d60199959093a569d23188c45bbd6975c0f", "ja": "飯ごうでご飯を炊くと、美味しいんだよ～！\nおこげができたりして……♪", "zh": "用饭盒煮的饭很好吃喔～！\n还会煮出锅巴……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1056_022ser", "source_sha256": "d95d7b8cf1f789b02d99418629806f38948cd43a5d7583f3506a837ed4fb51d0", "ja": "そうなんですか？　{$P$}さん、\nわたし、飯ごうでご飯を炊いてみたいです！", "zh": "是这样吗？{$P$}先生，\n我想试试看用饭盒煮饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ce3715c250ad59ad2b3690280871da67ce0ca332dd0511b83b8f1a69f691e5e7", "ja": "そうか……でも荷物が増えすぎるのも問題だし、\n今回は置いていこう。ご飯を炊くのはまた今度な？", "zh": "是吗……不过行李太多也是个问题，这次就先别带吧。\n我们下次再煮饭好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1058_022ser", "source_sha256": "f766198fe1620e3ea72da4a3fa70dabb021c1faa770283f674f2e7bfa5e3e755", "ja": "そうですか……。ちょっと残念ですけど、\nまた今度を楽しみにしてますね！", "zh": "这样啊……有点可惜，\n不过我会期待下次的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef9449893d6d0801aff582af31f132f05aad475de6c875fe84dfbe5e28581bfd", "ja": "{$P$}さん、荷物片付きましたよ！\n早く出発しましょう♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我整理好行李了喔！\n快点出发吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1060_p", "source_sha256": "a93d437e787baa1227bbe4684d052d2619e89c35aba4b9eaf5b8b09835866122", "ja": "よし。それじゃ、荷物を積み込んだら\nみんなも車に乗ってくれ。", "zh": "好，那把行李全部搬上车后，\n大家也都上车吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1061_p", "source_sha256": "a43f99df2c6bdcb9aada305e95043f56718b7edcfeca3f060f180dc2aab47620", "ja": "夜の山道だ。あらためて、気を引き締めていこう。\nそれじゃ、出発だ！", "zh": "我们要在晚上走山路，这次真的要绷紧神经喔。\n那么，出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_02_1048_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
